# Obsidian settings are supplied by the framework repository.
/.obsidian/
/.trash/
/system/templates/
/wiki/insights/_template.md
/wiki/projects/_template.md
/wiki/references/_template.md

# Machine-local and secret-bearing files never belong in the knowledge repository.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/credentials*.json
**/secrets*.json
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Kept source videos can exceed GitHub's practical file limits. Back them up separately.
/outputs/video-knowledge/media/
